sequenceDiagram
    actor Candidate as Freelancer
    actor Recruiter
    participant UI
    participant RMS
    participant Payment
    participant DB

    Recruiter->>UI: Create Freelance Project
    UI->>RMS: Save Project
    RMS->>DB: Store Project

    Candidate->>UI: Submit Proposal
    UI->>RMS: Save Proposal
    RMS->>DB: Store Proposal

    Recruiter->>UI: Accept Proposal
    UI->>Payment: Deposit Escrow
    Payment-->>UI: Escrow Confirmed

    Candidate->>UI: Submit Milestone
    UI->>RMS: Upload Work
    RMS->>DB: Save Milestone

    Recruiter->>UI: Approve Work

    UI->>Payment: Release Payment
    Payment-->>Candidate: Payment Transferred

    Recruiter->>UI: Submit Review
    UI->>DB: Save Review